<noinclude>
This template places a location dot and optional label on the Balboa map.

Usage:
{{Balboa location
| lat = 0.5
| long = -82.25
| label = City Name
| label_position = top
| width = 300
}}
</noinclude><includeonly>{{Location map
| Balboa
| label = {{{label|}}}
| label_position = {{{label_position|top}}}
| lat = {{{lat|}}}
| long = {{{long|}}}
| width = {{{width|300}}}
| mark = Red pog.svg
| marksize = 6
| background = transparent
}}</includeonly>
